<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="view_dolan_inflation_index_list" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">dolan.inflation.index.list</field>
        <field name="model">dolan.inflation.index</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <list editable="top">
                <field name="month" widget="date"/>
                <field name="value"/>
                <field name="note"/>
            </list>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="action_dolan_inflation_index" model="ir.actions.act_window">
        <field name="name">Índices FACPCE</field>
        <field name="res_model">dolan.inflation.index</field>
        <field name="view_mode">list</field>
        <field name="help" type="html">
            <p class="o_view_nocontent_smiley_face">Cargá los índices FACPCE</p>
            <p>Uno por mes, tal como los publica la FACPCE. También podés importarlos desde un CSV (mes;índice).</p>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="view_dolan_inflation_index_import_wizard_form" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">dolan.inflation.index.import.wizard.form</field>
        <field name="model">dolan.inflation.index.import.wizard</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <form string="Importar índices FACPCE">
                <p class="text-muted">CSV con dos columnas: mes (MM/AAAA o AAAA-MM) e índice. Los meses existentes se actualizan.</p>
                <group>
                    <field name="filename" invisible="1"/>
                    <field name="file" filename="filename"/>
                </group>
                <footer>
                    <button name="action_import" string="Importar" type="object" class="btn-primary"/>
                    <button string="Cancelar" class="btn-secondary" special="cancel"/>
                </footer>
            </form>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="action_dolan_inflation_index_import" model="ir.actions.act_window">
        <field name="name">Importar índices FACPCE</field>
        <field name="res_model">dolan.inflation.index.import.wizard</field>
        <field name="view_mode">form</field>
        <field name="target">new</field>
    </record>

    <record id="view_dolan_inflation_adjustment_wizard_form" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">dolan.inflation.adjustment.wizard.form</field>
        <field name="model">dolan.inflation.adjustment.wizard</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <form string="Ajuste por inflación (RT 6)">
                <field name="state" invisible="1"/>
                <field name="currency_id" invisible="1"/>
                <group>
                    <group>
                        <field name="date_from" readonly="state != 'draft'"/>
                        <field name="date_to" readonly="state != 'draft'"/>
                        <field name="closing_index" invisible="state == 'draft'"/>
                    </group>
                    <group>
                        <field name="company_id" groups="base.group_multi_company" readonly="state != 'draft'"/>
                        <field name="journal_id" readonly="state == 'done'"/>
                        <field name="recpam_account_id" readonly="state == 'done'"/>
                        <field name="move_id" invisible="not move_id"/>
                    </group>
                </group>
                <div class="text-muted" invisible="state != 'draft'">
                    Se reexpresan las cuentas marcadas "Ajusta por inflación" (activo fijo, patrimonio, resultados y las
                    que marques a mano, como bienes de cambio). Cada movimiento se ajusta desde su mes de origen y los
                    saldos de balance desde el cierre anterior.
                </div>
                <field name="line_ids" invisible="state == 'draft'">
                    <list>
                        <field name="currency_id" column_invisible="1"/>
                        <field name="account_id"/>
                        <field name="historical_balance" sum="Total"/>
                        <field name="restated_balance" sum="Total"/>
                        <field name="adjustment" sum="Total"/>
                    </list>
                </field>
                <group invisible="state == 'draft'">
                    <field name="total_adjustment"/>
                </group>
                <footer>
                    <button name="action_suggest_accounts" string="Marcar cuentas no monetarias" type="object"
                            class="btn-secondary" invisible="state != 'draft'"/>
                    <button name="action_compute" string="Calcular" type="object" class="btn-primary"
                            invisible="state == 'done'"/>
                    <button name="action_post" string="Contabilizar asiento" type="object" class="btn-primary"
                            invisible="state != 'computed'"/>
                    <button string="Cerrar" class="btn-secondary" special="cancel"/>
                </footer>
            </form>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="action_dolan_inflation_adjustment_wizard" model="ir.actions.act_window">
        <field name="name">Ajuste por inflación</field>
        <field name="res_model">dolan.inflation.adjustment.wizard</field>
        <field name="view_mode">form</field>
        <field name="target">new</field>
    </record>

    <record id="view_account_form_dolan_inflation" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">account.account.form.dolan.inflation</field>
        <field name="model">account.account</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="account.view_account_form"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr="//field[@name='account_type']" position="after">
                <field name="dolan_inflation_adjustable"/>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>

    <menuitem id="menu_dolan_inflation_adjustment"
              name="Ajuste por inflación (RT 6)"
              parent="account.menu_finance_entries"
              action="action_dolan_inflation_adjustment_wizard"
              sequence="96"/>
    <menuitem id="menu_dolan_inflation_index"
              name="Índices FACPCE"
              parent="account.menu_finance_configuration"
              action="action_dolan_inflation_index"
              sequence="96"/>
    <menuitem id="menu_dolan_inflation_index_import"
              name="Importar índices FACPCE"
              parent="account.menu_finance_configuration"
              action="action_dolan_inflation_index_import"
              sequence="97"/>
</odoo>
